# Move publish metadata — the CLI's own `--pubfile-path` output only ever holds
# ephemeral test-publish ids, never a real deployment (`sui client publish` refuses
# --pubfile-path outright); root-level published.toml is hand-maintained instead
# and tracks real deployments, so it's exempted below.
**/Published.toml
**/Pub.*.toml
!/published.toml

# read-only reference clone (do not vendor)
reference/
